participants: T1, Database, T2
T1 -> Database: BEGIN; SELECT balance (account 7)
Database --> T1: 500
T2 -> Database: BEGIN; UPDATE balance = 400; COMMIT
Database --> T2: committed
T1 -> Database: SELECT balance (account 7) again
Database --> T1: 400 (changed inside one transaction)
note over T1, Database: allowed at READ COMMITTED; prevented by REPEATABLE READ and SERIALIZABLE
